Gate
- A section is skipped only with a recorded pass, the same map hash and no change since that pass that its rows name. Otherwise it runs.
- Failing examples tested at the CLI, with nothing but git started: a null section with no earlier pass fails even when the plan file claims the skip; a section that ran and failed loses its pass.
- A section that fails in company runs alone first; if it passes it runs again after what ran before it, and only that run counts. Reason: 0.2.145, r29 alone passed where the full run failed.

