Decision for Aster and Sky: the remaining 10:15
Getting a HUD-only batch under 10 minutes needs step deltas, which this brief did not ask for and I did not build. When the engine, world and kit are unchanged, sim, unity-world, unity-match and the check's scenarios (about 263 s) prove nothing new; skipping them gives about 10:30 for a Hold change. Late-fight and tp-long (293 s) are frame-time checks that a HUD change can still affect, so skipping them is a real trade. Recommendation: do the first, keep the second.

